    <string name="alias_classic_info">With the incredibly popular Alias game, you get a whopping 3,200 words to explain and guess, ensuring the game remains exciting for a long time. Featuring a rich selection of words from categories such as Objects and things, People and professions, Adjectives and Verbs, the game also includes words from everyday life, the world of sports and recreation, entertainment, culture, and many more.</string>
    <string name="alias_football_info">WILL YOUR EXPLANATION SCORE A GOAL?\nDive into the fantastic world of football! From heel kicks to shots on goal, Alias Football puts your vocabulary to the test in a fantastic way!</string>
    <string name="alias_cro_info">Dobrodošli u čarobni svijet Hrvatske kulture, gdje ćemo koristiti riječi i imena od prošlosti do sadašnjosti kao ključeve za otkrivanje tajni. Razmišljajte kao rječnički čarobnjaci dok koristite riječi poput \\"kralj Tomislav\\" i \\"Franjo Tuđman\\" te likove kao \\"profesor Baltazar\\" i \\"Mate Rimac\\" kako biste osvojili bodove u ovoj uzbudljivoj igri HR Alias.\n
Vaš zadatak je prenositi suštinu Hrvatske kulture kroz kreativne opise, sinonime, ili suprotna značenja kako biste pomogli svojim partnerima da pogode što više riječi prije nego što vrijeme istekne. Kroz ovu igru prepunu uzbuđenja, možete otkriti prave riječi i postati tim pobjednika u igri Alias! Započnite svoju avanturu i pokažite svoju maštovitost!</string>
    <string name="alias_srb_info">Dobrodošli u čarobni svet srpske kulture — od istorije do današnjih dana. Koristite reči i imena poput „Nikola Tesla“, „Sveti Sava“, „Novak Đoković“, „Kalemegdan“ i „ćevapi“ kao ključeve za pogađanje pojmova i osvajanje bodova u uzbudljivoj igri Alias Srbija.\n</string>
    <string name="alias_slo_info">Alias Slovenija preizkuša tvoje besedišče in poznavanje vsega, kar je slovensko!\n\nZ besedami in imeni iz priljubljenih otroških pravljicnih in literarnih junakov, Martina Krpana, Radovednega Tačka in Cicibana, pa do spoznavanja slovenskih kulturnih spomenikov, krajev, posebnosti, najbolj priljubljenih serij, knjig, jedi in slavnih ljudi. Alias Slovenija preizkuša tvoje besedišče in poznavanje vsega, kar je slovensko!</string>
    <string name="game_alias_uk_info">UK Alias - the exciting game where you explain words and learn more about the country you love the best!\n\nHow much do you know about the UK? This exciting word game requires players to explain words and learn more about the country you love the best!\n\nWith 1,800 words about UK sports, culture history and much more, this game is perfect for the whole family.</string>
    <string name="game_alias_junior_info">Explain words and images to your team members using words with the same, similar, or opposite meanings, mimicking sounds or actions, and more. This game can also be played by children who cannot yet read, as there are corresponding pictures next to the words. Each team tries to guess as many words as possible before the time runs out on the hourglass. Play this fast, dynamic, and insanely fun game!\nAlias Junior is a game for the whole family!</string>
    <string name="game_taboo_info">Taboo, my friends, is the ultimate party word extravaganza! Picture this: you and your pals huddled around, trying to describe some wacky word or phrase from a card without dropping four super obvious hints that are also on the card.\n\nBut wait, there\'s more! Your rivals are there too, keeping a keen eye on the clock, ready to buzz you like a pesky mosquito if you let those forbidden words slip from your lips or if you decide to pull out your best interpretive dance moves.\n\nThe thrill is real, folks! For every card your team conquers, you earn yourself a precious point. It\'s like a wordy battle of wits, and it\'s an absolute blast! So, if you\'re on the hunt for a party game that\'ll have you laughing, yelling, and maybe even doing some ninja-like word acrobatics, Taboo is your ticket to an epic evening!</string>
    <string name="game_nba_info">CAN YOUR EXPLANATION DELIVER A SLAM DUNK?\nEnter the electrifying world of the NBA, where every word counts as much as every point. From buzzer beaters and fast breaks to slam dunks, legendary teams and iconic players, Alias NBA brings the thrill of basketball to your table and challenges your skills in a truly exciting way.</string>
    <string name="alias_movies_info">LIGHTS, CAMERA, ACTION!\nStep into the dazzling world of cinema, where every clue is a scene and every guess could be a blockbuster. From timeless classics and cult favorites to Hollywood stars and unforgettable lines, Alias Movies turns your game night into a red-carpet event and challenges your knowledge in the most entertaining way.</string>
    <string name="game_alias_who_am_i_info">CAN YOU GUESS WHO YOU ARE?\nStep into the shoes of the world\'s most famous faces — from movie stars, athletes and musicians to cartoon heroes, historical legends and everyday characters. In Who Am I? every clue points to a famous name, and it\'s up to your team to guess it before time runs out. A hilarious, fast-paced guessing game that puts your pop-culture knowledge to the ultimate test.</string>
    <string name="game_alias_who_am_i">Who Am I?</string>
